            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.762,
            0.736,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Manasa is going outside to play. Her mother says, “Wear"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.781,
            0.735,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "your hat and shoes!” Which one should she wear first? She can wear her hat first and then her shoes. Or she can wear her shoes first and then her hat."
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.26,
            0.857,
            0.736,
            0.914
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Manasa will look exactly the same in both cases. Imagine a different situation: Manasa’s mother says “Wear your socks and shoes!” Now the"
            }
          ]
